  <History Date="24-10-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (charts only.  Protocol rev. 0.91/ firmware 01.22)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="16-02-20" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised collimate DMX end to 65028 in response to customer feedback (latest charts - Protocol rev 0.93 FW 01.26 only list in 8bit at 100 = 25700)" Version="2" />
  <History Date="16-02-20" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added product thumbnail.  Updated gobo scroll and control functions/macros in line with latest charts." Version="2" />
  <History Date="05-04-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added split patch option for Standard mode.  Revised attribute names to better distinguish which part they relate to where relevant.  Revised cell names from main to beam." Version="3" />
